WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:01.368
Hello.

00:00:01.368 --> 00:00:02.268
I'm Julia Chatterley.

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:03.503
And we begin with breaking news

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:05.171
from two locations.

00:00:05.171 --> 00:00:05.605
North

00:00:05.605 --> 00:00:06.840
Korea has just launched

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:09.009
another suspected ballistic missile.

00:00:09.376 --> 00:00:10.110
We'll have more on

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:10.977
all the details on that

00:00:10.977 --> 00:00:12.412
in just a moment's time.

00:00:12.412 --> 00:00:14.447
But first to Pakistan.

00:00:14.914 --> 00:00:15.415
The former

00:00:15.415 --> 00:00:16.449
Pakistani prime minister,

00:00:16.449 --> 00:00:18.952
Imran Khan, has been shot and injured

00:00:19.386 --> 00:00:21.588
His party says an unidentified gunmen

00:00:21.588 --> 00:00:24.290
opened fire at a rally putting his foot.

00:00:24.758 --> 00:00:25.525
They're calling it

00:00:25.525 --> 00:00:27.694
an assassination attempt.

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:28.895
This video was released in

00:00:28.895 --> 00:00:30.263
just the past few minutes

00:00:30.263 --> 00:00:32.766
showing calm, being helped into a car.

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:34.167
Let's go straight now

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:36.569
to Safia Southey, who's in Islamabad

00:00:36.569 --> 00:00:37.170
for us. Severe.

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:38.972
What more do we know about his health

00:00:38.972 --> 00:00:39.873
and who else perhaps

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:43.276
was injured in this attack to

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:44.577
Julie?

00:00:44.577 --> 00:00:45.779
We know that this happened

00:00:45.779 --> 00:00:47.080
in the town of Good Traveler.

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:47.847
We know that Imran

00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:50.116
Khan has been shot in the foot.

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:52.285
He's been taken directly

00:00:52.285 --> 00:00:54.320
to the main city of Lahore,

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:56.222
one of the largest cities in the country,

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:58.058
which is close to Gujarat.

00:00:58.058 --> 00:01:00.794
We also know by members of his party,

00:01:00.794 --> 00:01:03.496
the BCCI, that there has been one death,

00:01:03.496 --> 00:01:05.098
one person has died

00:01:05.098 --> 00:01:05.765
in this shooting

00:01:05.765 --> 00:01:07.901
that took place on his convoy.

00:01:08.301 --> 00:01:11.271
We've seen images of Senator Fester

00:01:11.304 --> 00:01:14.340
Javaid, who is a close associate

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.241
of Imran Khan,

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:17.143
who usually travels with him

00:01:17.143 --> 00:01:18.178
on these rallies.

00:01:18.178 --> 00:01:20.013
He's been shot in the face.

00:01:20.013 --> 00:01:22.348
He's asked for people to pray for him.

00:01:22.348 --> 00:01:25.251
But we've also been told

00:01:25.351 --> 00:01:26.519
that the Pakistan Tehreek

00:01:26.519 --> 00:01:28.888
e Insaf, the PTI, Imran Khan's party,

00:01:29.089 --> 00:01:30.390
has put out a statement

00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:32.559
that this was an assassination

00:01:32.559 --> 00:01:34.094
attempt against Imran Khan.

00:01:34.094 --> 00:01:36.196
And we are already seeing they charged

00:01:36.196 --> 00:01:38.331
speeches and visuals coming out

00:01:38.331 --> 00:01:39.632
right of the back

00:01:39.632 --> 00:01:42.902
of this attack on the convoy

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:44.037
that was moving

00:01:44.037 --> 00:01:44.671
in the province

00:01:44.671 --> 00:01:45.738
of Punjab towards

00:01:45.738 --> 00:01:47.407
the capital city of Islamabad.

00:01:47.407 --> 00:01:49.409
Khan launched this

00:01:50.643 --> 00:01:51.377
rally, this

00:01:51.377 --> 00:01:53.279
long march about a week ago

00:01:53.279 --> 00:01:54.481
calling for early elections.

00:01:54.481 --> 00:01:55.815
And he had said

00:01:55.815 --> 00:01:57.484
that he fears for his life.

00:01:57.484 --> 00:01:59.719
And we've seen for our Chaudhry

00:01:59.719 --> 00:02:01.454
former information minister,

00:02:01.454 --> 00:02:02.255
a senior party

00:02:02.255 --> 00:02:04.157
leader of the PTI,

00:02:04.157 --> 00:02:06.326
making very charge statements

00:02:06.326 --> 00:02:08.027
that while that party

00:02:08.027 --> 00:02:09.429
is a party of peace,

00:02:09.429 --> 00:02:11.664
that there will be revenge for this,

00:02:11.664 --> 00:02:14.200
the blood of their workers has flowed,

00:02:14.501 --> 00:02:16.469
the blood of their leader has flowed.

00:02:16.469 --> 00:02:17.070
And it's a very

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:19.239
politically charged atmosphere

00:02:19.239 --> 00:02:19.939
in this country,

00:02:19.939 --> 00:02:21.241
which is already

00:02:21.241 --> 00:02:24.611
very polarized because of the various

00:02:25.011 --> 00:02:26.246
political developments

00:02:26.246 --> 00:02:28.014
that have taken place here in Pakistan

00:02:28.014 --> 00:02:29.816
over the past couple of months.

00:02:29.816 --> 00:02:32.619
We're waiting for the interior minister

00:02:32.819 --> 00:02:35.822
to start a press conference to explain

00:02:35.922 --> 00:02:37.690
who was behind the dark,

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:39.225
what actually unfolded.

00:02:39.225 --> 00:02:40.360
There have been visuals

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:42.028
that have been splashed across

00:02:42.028 --> 00:02:43.296
all local channels.

00:02:43.296 --> 00:02:44.497
We're just trying to figure out

00:02:44.497 --> 00:02:46.132
what's actually happened.

00:02:46.132 --> 00:02:48.935
But there is without a doubt, the fact

00:02:48.935 --> 00:02:51.871
that the convoy of Imran Khan,

00:02:52.071 --> 00:02:54.908
a hugely, immensely popular politician

00:02:55.141 --> 00:02:56.709
and former cricket player here

00:02:56.709 --> 00:02:58.111
in this country,

00:02:58.111 --> 00:02:59.812
his convoy has been attacked

00:02:59.812 --> 00:03:01.247
and one person is dead

00:03:01.247 --> 00:03:03.283
with at least three others injured

00:03:03.283 --> 00:03:04.617
apart from Imran Khan.

00:03:04.617 --> 00:03:06.686
Julia, very it's interesting.

00:03:06.686 --> 00:03:07.754
And you mentioned it.

00:03:07.754 --> 00:03:09.722
And it's not just Imran Khan himself,

00:03:09.722 --> 00:03:10.723
but those around him

00:03:10.723 --> 00:03:11.758
have been concerned

00:03:11.758 --> 00:03:13.026
about threats to his life.

00:03:13.026 --> 00:03:14.761
And ever since he was ousted

00:03:14.761 --> 00:03:16.162
as prime minister, he's

00:03:16.162 --> 00:03:17.497
been increasingly vocal

00:03:17.497 --> 00:03:19.532
against the incumbent government.

00:03:19.699 --> 00:03:20.934
I just wonder

00:03:20.934 --> 00:03:22.936
when we're looking at these images,

00:03:22.936 --> 00:03:24.504
what security

00:03:24.504 --> 00:03:25.371
does he have,

00:03:25.371 --> 00:03:27.273
what security around him

00:03:27.273 --> 00:03:29.142
and how has that changed

00:03:29.142 --> 00:03:31.377
since he was prime minister, particularly

00:03:31.377 --> 00:03:33.413
in light of the threats to his life?

00:03:33.413 --> 00:03:34.447
And they've been ongoing

00:03:37.283 --> 00:03:39.752
Well, Julia, every time we've had press

00:03:39.752 --> 00:03:40.053
you know,

00:03:40.053 --> 00:03:41.487
press conferences

00:03:41.487 --> 00:03:43.022
with Imran Khan, press briefings

00:03:43.022 --> 00:03:44.257
with Imran Khan,

00:03:44.257 --> 00:03:47.260
we've been told by Khan and we've no

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:50.096
security detail that travels with him.

00:03:50.096 --> 00:03:52.565
A private security detail of the attack

00:03:52.565 --> 00:03:53.466
also took place

00:03:53.466 --> 00:03:54.834
in the province of Punjab

00:03:54.834 --> 00:03:56.169
when Imran Klein's party

00:03:56.169 --> 00:03:58.271
holds the provincial government.

00:03:58.271 --> 00:04:00.940
He has again said that he has

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:02.242
enough security

00:04:02.242 --> 00:04:04.711
from the present government in the past

00:04:04.711 --> 00:04:05.878
couple of weeks.

00:04:05.878 --> 00:04:07.113
The government itself

00:04:07.113 --> 00:04:07.947
had said that

00:04:07.947 --> 00:04:10.383
he's leading a bloody march.

00:04:10.383 --> 00:04:12.552
He this past week, for example,

00:04:13.052 --> 00:04:15.521
in Pakistan has been highly polarized.

00:04:15.521 --> 00:04:17.490
It's almost like a microcosm

00:04:17.490 --> 00:04:19.158
of what's been happening in the past

00:04:19.158 --> 00:04:19.859
couple of months.

00:04:19.859 --> 00:04:21.394
We had a senior

00:04:21.394 --> 00:04:22.762
journalist who had been critical

00:04:22.762 --> 00:04:23.763
of the establishment,

00:04:23.763 --> 00:04:25.565
who was mysteriously killed.

00:04:25.565 --> 00:04:29.702
Assassin was killed by gunshot in Kenya.

00:04:29.902 --> 00:04:31.170
We had the director

00:04:31.170 --> 00:04:32.672
general of the intelligence

00:04:32.672 --> 00:04:34.007
services, Pakistan's

00:04:34.974 --> 00:04:35.808
eyes and

00:04:35.808 --> 00:04:36.542
doesn't even like to

00:04:36.542 --> 00:04:37.410
be photographed

00:04:37.410 --> 00:04:39.512
making a press conference appearance.

00:04:39.746 --> 00:04:40.680
And for the first time,

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:42.181
Pakistan's history

00:04:42.181 --> 00:04:44.250
countering Imran Khan's narrative

00:04:44.984 --> 00:04:45.985
a military coup

00:04:45.985 --> 00:04:47.887
against the current government.

00:04:47.887 --> 00:04:51.391
There has been a complete battle

00:04:51.691 --> 00:04:53.760
and it's been an embattled situation

00:04:53.760 --> 00:04:54.527
with Imran Khan

00:04:54.527 --> 00:04:56.496
calling for early elections, he said.

00:04:56.496 --> 00:04:58.197
And I spoke to him

00:04:58.197 --> 00:04:59.532
just last month in a briefing

00:04:59.532 --> 00:05:00.833
and I asked him that look,

00:05:00.833 --> 00:05:02.335
for example, in me,

00:05:02.335 --> 00:05:03.603
Imran Khan's rallies,

00:05:03.603 --> 00:05:04.771
which gathered

00:05:04.771 --> 00:05:07.040
thousands of his supporters.

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:09.175
There was a clash in May

00:05:09.575 --> 00:05:11.611
when many of his supporters were tear gas

00:05:11.611 --> 00:05:13.446
and had to stop their protest

00:05:13.446 --> 00:05:14.580
against the current government.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:16.683
Imran Khan has said that he wants

00:05:16.683 --> 00:05:17.884
the elections,

00:05:17.884 --> 00:05:18.718
but also said that

00:05:18.718 --> 00:05:19.852
he feared for his life.

00:05:19.852 --> 00:05:20.820
So going back to what

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:22.822
you just asked about his security,

00:05:22.822 --> 00:05:23.589
the prime minister

00:05:23.589 --> 00:05:24.724
has released a statement

00:05:24.724 --> 00:05:25.458
saying that,

00:05:25.458 --> 00:05:25.725
you know,

00:05:25.725 --> 00:05:26.859
he condemns the attack

00:05:26.859 --> 00:05:28.928
and there will be a probe into this.

00:05:29.295 --> 00:05:31.130
But Imran Khan had already said

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:32.432
in the days and weeks

00:05:32.432 --> 00:05:34.300
leading up to this exact

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:35.034
long march

00:05:35.034 --> 00:05:37.103
towards the capital that he did fear

00:05:37.537 --> 00:05:39.339
for his life. Julia.

